 * 3. Backend Architecture & Microservices (NestJS, Node.js, Laravel, Microservices, Python, Bash)
 * 4. Databases, DevOps & Cloud (PostgreSQL, MySQL, MongoDB, Docker, GitHub Actions CI/CD)
 * 
 * Aligned with E2E test suites:
 * - tests/e2e/tier1_features.test.js (T1.F04.01 - T1.F04.06)
 * - tests/e2e/tier2_boundaries.test.js (T2.F04.01 - T2.F04.06)
 * - tests/e2e/tier3_interactions.test.js (T3.10)
 * - tests/e2e/tier4_scenarios.test.js (T4.02, T4.06)
 */

